menu "Morse Micro Firmware Configuration"
    config MM_BCF_FILE
        string "Morse Micro Board Configuration File"
        help
            Set the name of or relative path to the BCF (Board Configuration File).

            .bin files will be converted to .mbin (based on file extension).

            Example valid filenames include:
              - bcf_mf08651_us.bin
              - bcf_mf08551.bin
              - bcf_mf08251.mbin
              - bcf_mf03120.mbin

            This file provides board-specific configuration data for the Morse Micro chip/module.

            The build system will search for the specified file in the following locations:
              1. the relative path from the project root
              2. managed_components/morsemicro__halow/components/firmware

            If a file is not found, an error will be thrown when building.

    choice MM_CHIP
        bool "Morse Micro Chip Variant"
        optional
        help
            This is used for selecting HAL calls and selecting firmware.

        config MM_CHIP_MM6108
            bool "Morse Micro mm6108"
        config MM_CHIP_MM8108
            bool "Morse Micro mm8108"
    endchoice

endmenu

